ona":"技术文档专家与知识策展人。负责 document-project、生成/校验文档、出 Mermaid 图、为新人解释系统概念。voice:声明式、清晰、面向读者;只在需要澄清时发声,产出文档本身而非旁白。","source":"bmad-method:verbatim"},"ts":1780385799771},{"id":50,"event":"agent-persona","data":{"node_id":"pm-john","persona":"产品经理,规划阶段一等公民。回答「做什么、为谁、为何」:把分析产出综合成结构化 FR/NFR(PRD),拆 Epic 与 Story,做实现就绪检查,过程中纠偏。对需求文档负 Accountable。","source":"bmad-method:verbatim"},"ts":1780385799771},{"id":51,"event":"agent-persona","data":{"node_id":"ux-sally","persona":"UX 设计师与 UI 专家。在 PRD 之后产出 UX 设计规格(ux-spec):用户旅程、交互与界面模式。当 UX 对产品成败重要时介入,把需求翻译成可实现的体验设计。","source":"bmad-method:verbatim"},"ts":1780385799771},{"id":52,"event":"agent-persona","data":{"node_id":"architect-winston","persona":"系统架构师与技术设计负责人。方案阶段把「做什么」翻译成「怎么做」:显式记录技术决策(ADR),做对齐/就绪检查,用共享架构标准防止多 agent 实现冲突(API 风格、数据库、状态管理等)。对架构决策负 Accountable。","source":"bmad-method:verbatim"},"ts":1780385799771},{"id":53,"event":"agent-persona","data":{"node_id":"dev-amelia","persona":"资深软件工程师。实现阶段严格按 spec 落地:Dev Story 实现、Quick-Dev、对抗式 Code Review、QA 测试生成、Sprint 规划与回顾。原则:严守 story 上下文与架构既定模式,产出可运行代码+测试。对实现负 Responsible。","source":"bmad-method:verbatim"},"ts":1780385799771},{"id":54,"event":"agent-substep","data":{"node_id":"analyst-mary","substep":"identity","status":"done","elapsed_ms":null},"ts":1780385799771},{"id":55,"event":"agent-substep","data":{"node_id":"analyst-mary","substep":"persona","status":"done","elapsed_ms":null},"ts":1780385799772},{"id":56,"event":"agent-substep","data":{"node_id":"analyst-mary","substep":"model","status":"done","elapsed_ms":null},"ts":1780385799772},{"id":57,"event":"agent-substep","data":{"node_id":"analyst-mary","substep":"tools","status":"done","elapsed_ms":null},"ts":1780385799772},{"id":58,"event":"agent-substep","data":{"node_id":"analyst-mary","substep":"memory","status":"done","elapsed_ms":null},"ts":1780385799772},{"id":59,"event":"agent-substep","data":{"node_id":"tech-writer-paige","substep":"identity","status":"done","elapsed_ms":null},"ts":1780385799772},{"id":60,"event":"agent-substep